# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# git — line endings and diff drivers; every text file is stored with LF.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Normalize line endings to LF for every file git detects as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Rust sources get the `rust` diff driver for better hunk headers.
*.rs text diff=rust
*.toml text
*.md text
# The lockfile is generated; do not show its diff.
*.lock text -diff
